{"created": "2026-09-26T22:25:18.413842+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-26T22:25:18.998748+00:00", "id": 22908353, "conceptrecid": "21860110", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22908353", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21860110", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22908353", "metadata": {"title": "Seoul Sidewalk Accessibility Image Dataset", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22908353", "publication_date": "2026-09-23", "description": "<h1>Seoul Sidewalk Accessibility Image Dataset</h1>\n<p>This is the public release of the Seoul Sidewalk Accessibility Image Dataset.</p>\n<p>The dataset contains pedestrian-level sidewalk images collected in Seoul, Republic of Korea, together with ground-truth accessibility attributes: field-measured sidewalk width, longitudinal slope, and cross slope, and pavement condition grades assigned by three independent raters and resolved by majority vote.</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>Dataset contents</h2>\n<p>The dataset includes ground-truth annotations for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sidewalk width</li>\n<li>Longitudinal slope</li>\n<li>Cross slope</li>\n<li>Pavement condition</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Ground-truth attributes are stored in the csv file <code>summary_attributes.csv</code>&nbsp;where the <code>filename</code> column gives the corresponding image file name in <code>imagery.zip</code>.</p>\n<p>The 514 sidewalk images are split into three archives:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>imagery_1.zip</code></li>\n<li><code>imagery_2.zip</code></li>\n<li><code>imagery_3.zip</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p>All three archives must be downloaded to obtain the complete image set.</p>\n<p>Detailed descriptions of the ground-truth measurement and annotation procedures are provided in the documentation in <code>ground_truth_protocol.zip</code>.</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2>Citation</h2>\n<p>Please cite the associated manuscript and Zenodo dataset record when using this dataset.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Lieu, Seung Jae", "affiliation": "Massachusetts Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0000-0003-3512-0822"}, {"name": "Morra, Diego", "affiliation": "Massachusetts Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0000-0001-7275-6219"}, {"name": "Cadoni, Chiara", "affiliation": "Massachusetts Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0009-0004-6845-7987"}, {"name": "Song, Wonseop", "affiliation": "Massachusetts Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0009-0005-6981-148X"}, {"name": "Mazzarello, Martina", "affiliation": "Massachusetts Institute of Technology", "orcid": "0000-0001-8777-3927"}, {"name": "Ratti, Carlo", "affiliation": "Massachusetts Institute of Technology"}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-zero"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 2, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21860110"}}]}}, "title": "Seoul Sidewalk Accessibility Image Dataset", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22908353", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22908353", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22908353?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22908353", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22908353", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22908353", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22908353/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21860110", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21860110", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21860110", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21860110", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22908353/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22908353/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22908353/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22908353/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22908353/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22908353/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22908353/versions", "draft": "https://z